This library statically links TagLib (LGPLv2.1) in the audio_tags_taglib
package. TagLib is © Scott Wheeler and contributors, distributed under the
GNU Lesser General Public License version 2.1 or later.

  https://taglib.org/
  https://github.com/taglib/taglib/blob/master/COPYING.LGPL

This library statically links Lofty-rs (MIT) in the audio_tags_lofty package.
Lofty is © Serial-ATA and contributors, distributed under the MIT License.

  https://github.com/Serial-ATA/lofty-rs

End users distributing applications built with audio_tags_taglib must comply
with TagLib's LGPL terms — typically by linking dynamically or by providing
the relinking artefacts. The default build hook produces a self-contained
shim with TagLib statically embedded; this satisfies LGPL section 4(d) when
combined with this LICENSE file and the build scripts (build_linux.sh,
build_macos.sh, build_windows.ps1) that allow a user to relink.
